#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Website for the Ukrainian locale of the German original website https://www.wortmann.de/ (modern computers, laptops, monitors etc.). The goal is to replicate all fonts, colors, styles, menu structure, logos, icons and buttons of the original home page in this project, then use those styles to build a few more pages such as About us. A full visual copy only: all links point to the original website. Work starts with the home page."
